---
source: crates/tungstate-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Keep folders in the shape you declared.

Usage: tungstate <COMMAND>

Commands:
  folder      Manage governed folders
  init        Give a folder a starting set of rules
  link        Manage transfer links between folders
  sync        Keep a set of folders in step, on this machine or elsewhere
  connection  Manage connections to places other than this machine
  log         Show everything that ever happened to a path
  whereis     Show where a file ended up
  explain     Show where a policy would put a file, and why
  plan        Work out what would have to happen for a folder to match its policy
  apply       Carry out a plan: make the folder match its policy
  dedupe      Find files that are the same file, and deal with the extra copies
  watch       Keep governed folders in order while this runs
  undo        Put back what `tungstate apply` did
  storage     Keep, clear and bring back what tungstate remembers
  policy      Check and inspect policies
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
